      "spam": false,
      "value": "If not full messages, at least some sort of quick menu options to send to friends, so you can quickly let them know:\n\"Hey I wanna hang out\n\"Sorry, Busy\" (Perhaps some other words, that can be alsoused in tandem, to further explain:  Testing, with a friend, private conversation, etc.)\n\"Can I come there?\"  (especially places I can't directly join, due to settings of the world, but at least let them know so they can tell who can invite.)\n\nJust some example ideas.\n\nSure, having a more verbose response, using that keyboard would be optional, but with VR users, it's harder to type.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
